            </note>
            <note corresp="#d824-f3" n="11" xml:id="d824-f3-content">
                <p>George Atcheson, Jr.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d824-f4" n="12" xml:id="d824-f4-content">
                <p>Chiang Kai-shek, President of the National Government of the Republic of
                    China.</p>
            </note>
